9a4371`.\nPatch: `stk50-51.patch`.\n\nThe approved migration `2026_11_07_003800_narrow_purchase_order_and_supplier_invoice_approvers.php` revokes exactly two web-role grants: Finance Officer purchase-order approval and Director supplier-invoice mismatch approval. Down restores these two grants. Catalogue, service wording, UI wording, synthetic walk/trial actors and the historically approved assertions align with this boundary. No staff-management grants change. Beyond recovered source, the handoff-approved InventoryWalkSeederTest Director expectation is included, alongside a stale comment correction and reconciled TEAM documentation preserving IMP-1.\n\nValidation: 10/10 focused frontend tests passed. Six focused backend classes passed 43/43 tests, 970 assertions, exit 0 in 66.956 seconds using explicit `--testsuite=Feature`. Full Pint and PHPStan passed with exit 0 (PHPStan errors: 0). JUnit and logs are included. Full branch/integration gate and visual/UAT review remain pending.\n\nRunner diagnosis retained for reproducibility: default discovery had exited 1 despite passing tests because the unchanged phpunit.xml repeats 64 files from Contention in Contention1/2/3. Laravel PAO's JSON summary omitted the warning-driven exit status. `--debug` exposed those warnings; a single migration rerun selecting Feature passed with exit 0, followed by the full 43-test focused rerun. No configuration, migration or assertion change suppressed warnings. Earlier Pint timeout evidence is retained but superseded by a successful direct serial Pint run.\n\nThe two patches share TEAM.md and InventoryOperationsPanel.vue; integrate deliberately from a clean main checkout and reconcile the two progress entries. They are individual exact review artifacts, not a claim that sequential blind application is conflict-free.\n\nLogs are copied into `evidence/`. The JSON manifests record the base, included untracked files and SHA-256 for each exact patch.\n\n\n\n\nPublication update26 November2026: owner authorized commit/push/draft PR preservation. Historical no-publication wording above is superseded for this draft. Migration down restores exactly the two revoked grants, as recorded in the historical approval; no production migration was run. This overlaps STK46 PermissionCatalogue/TEAM and the Stock UI, so integrate deliberately; do not blindly apply all patches.\n","created_at":"2026-11-26T14:49:32Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:49:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1154/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/1154/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/issues/1154/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/putrijayamediateam/KPOne/statuses/b224def5d70554a1e83a6c00f9e0256186a4749b","head":{"label":"putrijayamediateam:feature/stk-50-51-continue","ref":"feature/stk-50-51-continue","sha":"b224def5d70554a1e83a6c00f9e0256186a4749b","user":{"login":"putrijayamediateam","id":292030783,"node_id":"U_kgDOEWgJPw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292030783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam","html_url":"https://github.com/putrijayamediateam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putrijayamediateam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/putri